      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "index": "a00066",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "KEY DECISIONS\n1. Postgres IS the queue (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED). Enqueue + credit HOLD\n   commit in ONE transaction. No Redis/BullMQ split-brain.\n2. better-auth is TypeScript-only -> it lives in Next.js, issues a JWT,\n   FastAPI verifies it via JWKS. FastAPI never runs better-auth.\n3. Worker releases itself after provider submit; the provider webhook\n   resumes the step. A sleeping worker is a worker you pay for to idle.\n4. Every crash is recovered by the lease reaper, not by try/except in a\n   process that is already dying.\n5. Cloudflare = edge + R2 + CDN.  NOT the Python compute (see notes).",
      "rawText": "KEY DECISIONS\n1. Postgres IS the queue (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED). Enqueue + credit HOLD\n   commit in ONE transaction. No Redis/BullMQ split-brain.\n2. better-auth is TypeScript-only -> it lives in Next.js, issues a JWT,\n   FastAPI verifies it via JWKS. FastAPI never runs better-auth.\n3. Worker releases itself after provider submit; the provider webhook\n   resumes the step. A sleeping worker is a worker you pay for to idle.\n4. Every crash is recovered by the lease reaper, not by try/except in a\n   process that is already dying.\n5. Cloudflare = edge + R2 + CDN.  NOT the Python compute (see notes).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r448108235",
      "originalText": "KEY DECISIONS\n1. Postgres IS the queue (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED). Enqueue + credit HOLD\n   commit in ONE transaction. No Redis/BullMQ split-brain.\n2. better-auth is TypeScript-only -> it lives in Next.js, issues a JWT,\n   FastAPI verifies it via JWKS. FastAPI never runs better-auth.\n3. Worker releases itself after provider submit; the provider webhook\n   resumes the step. A sleeping worker is a worker you pay for to idle.\n4. Every crash is recovered by the lease reaper, not by try/except in a\n   process that is already dying.\n5. Cloudflare = edge + R2 + CDN.  NOT the Python compute (see notes).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
